From 54efe10435973e1c90dacb264050a6a714a82876 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 00:56:45 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(post): drill and thread ops take the tool feed; a
 feed above it is refused at the post

A new Drill or Thread op, and an op given a new tool, takes the tool's
stated feed (the row in force, else Tool::feed) inside the creating or
retargeting command. A program whose Drill or Thread op feeds above its
tool's feed is refused at the post by name (operation::feed_rating,
a clause of posting::verification_report). Saved files load unchanged
and are refused at their first post.

Fixes #2598

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
